## The runtime

This game stands on no engine, so the runtime under it is yours to write: the
frame loop and the delta time it measures, the canvas fit, the keyboard and
the pointer, audio cues including the ones that loop, loading the produced
files, and the debug overlay. Where this specification speaks of the runtime it
means that layer, and it states only what Volute needs from it. How the layer is
structured is yours to decide.
